  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At an Auspicious Festival stall before their home in Shang Clan City, Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing find three brothers who have all been thrashed by one or the other on the battle stage. Xiong Huo wears a sleeveless shirt and shorts with a bright red body. His brothers are Xiong Tu and Xiong Feng. All three have B grade aptitude, came to the city aiming to become Shang clan external elders, and can temporarily match a rank four Gu Master when their combination strike lands.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_xiong_tu",
        "char_xiong_feng",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a sleeveless shirt and shorts, and his body is bright red.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan presses them under Shang Xin Ci and then tosses a Fan half-token to Xiong Tu, Xiong Huo grabs the token and inspects it closely. After the halves fit and illusionary fire burns, the brothers kneel for a twenty year service oath under their grandfather’s debt and shout their three names in greeting to Lady Xin Ci.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_xin_ci"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s previous-life memory places them as descendants of the demonic Gu Master behind that Fan token, men who in that life found the stall half-token a year later and served its owner for twenty years before leaving.",
      "chapters": [
        329
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_demonic_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan lists the three Xiong brothers among Shang Xin Ci’s generals while building her young master force. When the group storms Zhou Quan’s manor, Xiong Huo gives an evil grin and kicks the doorboy flying after the boy blocks their way.",
      "chapters": [
        331
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "manor-raid-under-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_quan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Shang clan’s succession ceremony on Shang Liang Mountain, steward Zhou Quan looks at the three demonic path brothers Xiong Tu, Xiong Huo, and Xiong Feng and insists they must stay, that Shang Xin Ci cannot let them leave. Shang Xin Ci later summons him with Xiao Lan, Xiao Die, Wei De Xin, Zhou Quan, Xiong Tu, and Xiong Feng for arrangements.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "succession-ceremony",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_liang_mountain",
        "char_xiao_lan",
        "char_xiao_die",
        "char_wei_de_xin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration places Xiong Tu, Xiong Huo, and Xiong Feng as Shang Xin Ci’s three experts in the contest for the smoky warm jade field. The three join the battlefield together, work closely, and are more than most elders can match until they are sent out by Tie Ruo Nan’s advance.",
      "chapters": [
        1531
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-teamwork-and-defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_ruo_nan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiong Tu, Xiong Huo, and Xiong Feng receive information on how to save their ancestor Xiong Yan Po and leave, one of the moves that strips Shang Xin Ci of capable subordinates.",
      "chapters": [
        2122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "leaving-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
